---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { SUPPORT_EMAIL } from "../lib/constants";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="What Marked collects, why, who helps us run it, and how you can delete your data."
>
  <p>
    Marked is a trade journal for forex and crypto traders. This page explains
    what we collect when you use it, why, and what control you have.
  </p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Account details:</strong> your email address, your name, and a
      profile picture if you add one or sign in with Google.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Your journal:</strong> the trades, notes, tags and screenshots you
      add. This is the core of the service and it belongs to you.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Billing details:</strong> your plan, subscription status, billing
      dates and the reference numbers Paystack gives us. Your card details go to
      Paystack and are never stored by us.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Technical data:</strong> error reports and basic diagnostics that
      help us find and fix problems.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <p>
    To run your account, show your journal and analytics, take payment for Pro,
    keep the service secure, and fix bugs. We don't sell your data and we don't
    show ads.
  </p>

  <h2>Who helps us run Marked</h2>
  <p>We use a few providers to deliver the service. Each only gets what it needs:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Supabase</strong> for the database, sign-in and file storage.</li>
    <li><strong>Vercel</strong> for hosting this website and the app.</li>
    <li><strong>Paystack</strong> for payments and subscriptions.</li>
    <li><strong>Sentry</strong> for error monitoring.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Frankfurter</strong> for live exchange rates. When you look up a
      rate, only the two currency codes are sent.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Google</strong> if you choose to sign in with Google, and to serve
      the fonts on this website (which means Google sees your IP address when the
      page loads).
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Keeping and deleting your data</h2>
  <p>
    We keep your data while your account is open. You can delete your account at
    any time from your profile in the app. That removes your journal, your
    uploaded screenshots and your profile picture. If you have a Pro
    subscription, it is cancelled first so you aren't charged again.
    Paystack keeps its own payment records under its own policies.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You can see and correct your details in the app, export or delete your
    journal, and delete your account. If data protection law where you live,
    including the Nigeria Data Protection Act 2023, gives you further rights,
    such as asking what we hold about you, you can ask us to honour them.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>Marked is not meant for anyone under 18, and we don't knowingly collect their data.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    If we change this policy in a way that matters, we'll update the date above
    and tell you in the app or by email.
  </p>

  {
    SUPPORT_EMAIL ? (
      <>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about your data? Email <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>.
        </p>
      </>
    ) : null
  }
</LegalLayout>